        theory: ("{D} drove drunk for a seventh time.", "A friend drove and fled."),
        allocution: "\"I wasn't thinking about anyone else on the road.\"",
        truths: ("{DL} had been at a bar for four hours.", "The friend's name changed three times."),
        defendant: [.direct("Were you driving?", "\"No. I was a passenger. A friend was driving the truck when it left the road and rolled.\""), .direct("Who was driving?", "\"A friend. I will not pretend the friend is easy to find, and I know how that sounds.\""), .direct("Why did you have the keys?", "\"I took them. After the crash I pulled them from the ignition so nobody would be hurt by a running truck.\""), .direct("How did you get out of the truck?", "\"I crawled out of the passenger side. The driver's side was crushed, and my friend was gone when I stood up.\""), .direct("Why did your friend leave?", "\"I do not know. I think the friend panicked, because the friend had a lot to lose.\""), .direct("What do you want the jury to know?", "\"I have made mistakes with drinking, and I own them. I did not drive that night.\""), .cross("You have six earlier DWI convictions, don't you?", "\"Yes. I know. I know exactly how that looks.\""), .cross("You had twice the legal limit in your system, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I was drinking. That does not mean I was driving.\""), .cross("The keys were in your pocket, weren't they?", "\"Yes. I took them out of the ignition after the crash.\""), .cross("Nobody else was found at the scene, were they?", "\"No. The friend was gone. I wish I could explain it.\""), .cross("You cannot tell us where this friend lives, can you?", "\"Not with certainty. I have a first name and not much else.\"")],
        openings: ("On a country road, a trooper found {D}, who has six earlier DWI convictions, standing beside an overturned pickup with the keys in {D}'s pocket. {D}'s breath test later measured twice the legal limit.", "A friend was driving and walked away before the trooper arrived. A person who sits in the passenger seat of a wrecked truck is not the driver, whatever the record."),
