        defendant: [.direct("Did you inject {V}?", "\"A nurse did. I was a consultant at the clinic. I talked with patients about options and a nurse gave the shots.\""), .direct("Who was the nurse?", "\"A part-timer. A nurse who came in a few days a month and worked on whoever needed injections.\""), .direct("What is the nurse's name?", "\"I forget. It was a quick hire, and I cannot bring the name to mind right now.\""), .direct("What about the white coat?", "\"A uniform. I wore it for the clinic's image, and I never told anyone I was a doctor.\""), .direct("Where did the compound come from?", "\"A supplier I found online. I thought it was approved and relied on what the seller told me.\""), .direct("What do you want {V} to know?", "\"I am sorry you were hurt. I never wanted anyone to get sick, and I am heartsick about it.\""), .cross("You have no medical license, do you?", "\"No. I am a consultant, and I never claimed otherwise.\""), .cross("$4,000 was paid to you, wasn't it?", "\"To the clinic. I ran the business side, and the money was for the whole course.\""), .cross("You cannot name the nurse, can you?", "\"Not at this moment. I wish I could.\""), .cross("The vial was unapproved, wasn't it?", "\"So the lab says. I did not know.\""), .cross("You wore a white coat to look like a doctor, didn't you?", "\"To look professional. I did not intend to deceive anyone.\"")],
        openings: ("For two years {D} ran a wellness clinic offering joint injections at $4,000 a course in a white coat, with no medical license. {V} was hospitalized for weeks with a severe infection after an injection, and the vial held an unapproved compound bought online.", "{D} was a consultant and a nurse gave the shots. A clinic that bought a bad compound in good faith is a failure of care, not a fraud."),
        closings: ("No license in any state, a white coat, $4,000 a course, and a vial of an unlabeled compound. {V} paid and was nearly crippled.", "A consultant who never claimed to be a doctor, a nurse no one can name, and a compound bought online. The State must prove {D} knew it was unsafe."),
