        theory: ("{D} ignored a written notice and camped at {V}'s door.", "A visitor who fell asleep with a gift."),
        allocution: "\"I hurt people I love, and I'm sorry.\"",
        truths: ("{DL} had sent seven messages to {V} that evening.", "{DL} had learned the side entrance code from a former neighbor."),
        defendant: [.direct("Did you know about the notice?", "\"I knew. I got it, and I understood it. I should not have gone there.\""), .direct("Why did you go?", "\"To leave flowers and a gift. I wanted to say sorry and wish {V.him} well, and I could not do it any other way.\""), .direct("Why did you stay five hours?", "\"I fell asleep. I sat down to wait, I was exhausted from a double shift, and I dozed off.\""), .direct("How did you get in?", "\"Someone held the door. A resident was going in, and I slipped through behind that person.\""), .direct("What did you do outside the door?", "\"I knocked once and then waited. I set the bag and flowers down, and I closed my eyes.\""), .direct("What do you want {V} to know?", "\"I am sorry I scared you. I did not come to hurt you, and I will not come back.\""), .cross("You tailgated through a side entrance, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I know I should not have.\""), .cross("You were handed a written no-trespass notice, weren't you?", "\"Yes. I signed for it. I knew.\""), .cross("You stayed in the hallway for five hours, didn't you?", "\"Yes, though I was asleep for most of it.\""), .cross("{V} had asked you twice to stop contacting {V.him}, hadn't {V.he}?", "\"Yes. I did not stop, and I should have.\""), .cross("You carried flowers and food at 1 a.m. to a door you were told to stay away from, didn't you?", "\"Yes. It was a bad idea, and I regret that.\"")],
        openings: ("After a breakup, {V} gave {D} a written notice not to come to {V.his} apartment building. Around 1 a.m. a hallway camera showed {D} tailgate through a side entrance and settle on the floor outside {V}'s door with food and flowers for five hours.", "{D} came to leave a gift and fell asleep after a double shift. A foolish, sad visit with flowers is not a menace, even when the notice said stay away."),
