        exam: [.direct("What did the robber say?", "\"Empty the drawer. The voice was low and quick, and I did not hear anything else beyond that and a few curses.\""), .direct("What did you see of the gun?", "\"A dark pistol, pushed through the cashier window. I looked right into the barrel.\""), .direct("How was the robber dressed?", "\"A mask and dark clothes, with stitched gloves. I could see only the eyes and hands.\""), .direct("What did you hand over?", "\"$950 from the safe drawer. I opened it as fast as I could and pushed the cash through the window.\""), .direct("How did the robber leave?", "\"On a bicycle, across a muddy field behind the station. I watched until the robber was out of sight.\""), .direct("What did deputies find?", "\"A print in the mud and a glove with a distinctive stitch. They told me the glove had DNA on the cuff.\""), .cross("Could you see the face?", "\"No. The mask covered everything. I would not be able to pick anyone out.\""), .cross("What was the voice like?", "\"Low. I could not say more. I would not say it sounded like {D}.\""), .cross("How tall was the robber?", "\"Average height, I think. It was dark, and I was looking at the gun.\""), .cross("Did you know {D}?", "\"I do not recall ever seeing {D}. I could not say I knew {D} from the area.\""), .cross("Were you hurt?", "\"No. I was terrified, but I was not hurt.\"")],
