        summary: "{V}, 24, a nursing student, was found unresponsive in a rented room on {DATE} after taking a blue pill {V.he} bought two nights earlier. A medical examiner found fentanyl as the cause of death. {V}'s phone held messages and a payment app transfer to {D}, a shift lead at the warehouse where {V} worked part time. A search of {D}'s locker found a bag of similar pills. {DL} says {D.he} sold the pills at cost to coworkers and thought they were ordinary pain medicine.",
        state: [E(.forensic, 3, "Medical Examiner", "Fentanyl toxicity caused the death."), E(.digital, 3, "Payment App Messages", "{V} asks for 'two of the blues' and sends $40 to {D}."), E(.physical, 2, "Locker Search", "A bag of matching blue pills in {D}'s locker."), E(.forensic, 1, "Pill Analysis", "The pills in the locker contain fentanyl.")],
