        defendant: [.direct("Tell the jury about your job and your coworkers.", "\"I am a shift lead at a warehouse. I get along well with coworkers, and many of us were friends outside of work.\""), .direct("Did you sell {V} a pill?", "\"Yes. {V} asked for two, and I sold them. I thought they were pain pills, and I would never have sold them if I had known.\""), .direct("What did you tell {V} about the pills?", "\"That they were pain pills. I told another coworker they were strong and to take half. I did not know they held fentanyl.\""), .direct("How did you get the pills?", "\"I bought them in bulk for $8 each. I sold them at $20, and I know I made a profit.\""), .direct("Why did you keep pills in your locker?", "\"For my own use and to share. I did not think anyone would be hurt. I thought they were ordinary.\""), .direct("How are you coping with what happened?", "\"I feel horrible. {V} died because of a pill I sold. I think about it every day, and I wish I could take it back.\""), .cross("You told a coworker the pills were strong, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I said to take half. I thought they were strong pain pills, and I wanted people to be careful.\""), .cross("You paid $8 and charged $20, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I made a profit. I know it makes me a dealer, and I am sorry.\""), .cross("A bag of matching pills was in your locker, wasn't it?", "\"Yes. It was. I did not know they were fentanyl, and I did not test them.\""), .cross("Others in the chat also asked for pills, didn't they?", "\"Yes. I sold to a few coworkers. I thought they were ordinary pain pills.\""), .cross("You did not check what was in the pills, did you?", "\"No. I did not. I trusted the person I bought them from, and I know that was a mistake.\"")],
