        closings: ("Nine units opened overnight, {D}'s code entered twice, a pickup near unit row C, and bolt cutters in {D}'s truck. The generator was later listed online.", "A person moving out of a unit, a keypad code used openly, and bolt cutters carried for work. The State has not proved that {D} opened any other unit."),
        timeline: [(-1, "A listing."), (0, "1:12 a.m.: the first entry."), (0, "3:40 a.m.: the second."), (1, "Tenants report thefts.")],
